<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-songshu" book-id="b-songshu-049" chapter-id="c-songshu-049-sun-jigao-succession" source-id="s-songshu-049-sun-jigao-succession-ws2118585">
  <p id="c-songshu-049-sun-jigao-succession:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">義熙七年四月，<persName id="c-songshu-049-sun-jigao-succession:p001:m0007" ref="hx8_hzi_iq5">季高</persName>卒於晉康，時年五十三。追贈龍驤將軍、南海太守，封候官縣侯，食邑千戶。九年，高祖念<persName id="c-songshu-049-sun-jigao-succession:p001:m0049" ref="hx8_hzi_iq5">季高</persName>之功，乃表曰：「<persName id="c-songshu-049-sun-jigao-succession:p001:m0059" ref="hx8_hzi_iq5">孫季高</persName>嶺南之勳，已蒙褒贈。臣更思惟<persName id="c-songshu-049-sun-jigao-succession:p001:m0076" ref="m8n_ntm_79h_ABBA**A">盧循</persName>稔惡一紀，據有全域。若令根本未拔，投奔有所，招合餘燼，猶能為虞，縣師遠討，方勤廟算。而<persName id="c-songshu-049-sun-jigao-succession:p001:m0121" ref="hx8_hzi_iq5">季高</persName>汎海萬里，投命洪流，波激電邁，指日遄至，遂奄定南海，覆其巢窟，使<persName id="c-songshu-049-sun-jigao-succession:p001:m0155" ref="m8n_ntm_79h_ABBA**A">循</persName>進退靡依，輕舟遠迸。曾不旬月，妖凶殲殄。蕩滌之功，實庸為大。往年所贈，猶為未優。愚謂宜更贈一州，即其本號，庶令忠勳不湮，勞臣增厲。」重贈交州刺史，將軍如故。子<persName id="c-songshu-049-sun-jigao-succession:p001:m0235" ref="hx8_hzi_iq5_A">宗世</persName>卒，子<persName id="c-songshu-049-sun-jigao-succession:p001:m0240" ref="hx8_hzi_iq5_AA">欽公</persName>嗣。<persName id="c-songshu-049-sun-jigao-succession:p001:m0244" ref="hx8_hzi_iq5_AA">欽公</persName>卒，子<persName id="c-songshu-049-sun-jigao-succession:p001:m0249" ref="hx8_hzi_iq5_AAA">彥祖</persName>嗣。齊受禪，國除。</p>
</text>
